{"text":"kuruntokai","n":92,"lines":["ஞாயிறு பட்ட அகல்வாய் வானத்து","அளிய தாமே கொடுஞ்சிறைப் பறவை","இறையுறை வோங்கிய நெறியயல் மராஅத்த","பிள்ளை யுள்வாய்ச் செரீஇய","இரைகொண் டமையின் விரையுமாற் செலவே"],"tr":["ñāyiṟu paṭṭa akalvāy vāṉattu","aḷiya tāmē koṭuñciṟaip paṟavai","iṟaiyuṟai vōṅkiya neṟiyayal marāatta","piḷḷai yuḷvāyc cerīiya","iraikoṇ ṭamaiyiṉ viraiyumāṟ celavē"],"colophon":{"tinai":"neytal","tinai_ta":"நெய்தல்","speaker_ta":"தலைவி கூற்று","poet_ta":"தாமோதரனார்","speaker_en":"the heroine (talaivi)","poet_tr":"Tāmōtaraṉār"},"scan":{"meter":"nēricai āciriyappā","ok":true,"checks":[{"name":"lines","ok":true,"detail":"5 lines"},{"name":"feet per line","ok":true,"detail":"4×4, 1×3 feet"},{"name":"foot types","ok":true,"detail":"iyaṟcīr 17, veṇcīr 2"},{"name":"linkage","ok":true,"detail":"veṇṭaḷai 9, āciriyattaḷai 8, kalittaḷai 1"},{"name":"ending","ok":true,"detail":"ends on ஏ"}],"ending":"ஏ","lines":[[{"text":"ஞாயிறு","tr":"ñāyiṟu","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"ஞா","tr":"ñā"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"யிறு","tr":"yiṟu"}]},{"text":"பட்ட","tr":"paṭṭa","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"பட்","tr":"paṭ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ட","tr":"ṭa"}]},{"text":"அகல்வாய்","tr":"akalvāy","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"அகல்","tr":"akal"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"வாய்","tr":"vāy"}]},{"text":"வானத்து","tr":"vāṉattu","foot":"tēmāṅkāy","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"வா","tr":"vā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"னத்","tr":"ṉat"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"து","tr":"tu"}]}],[{"text":"அளிய","tr":"aḷiya","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"அளி","tr":"aḷi"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ய","tr":"ya"}]},{"text":"தாமே","tr":"tāmē","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"தா","tr":"tā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"மே","tr":"mē"}]},{"text":"கொடுஞ்சிறைப்","tr":"koṭuñciṟaip","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"கொடுஞ்","tr":"koṭuñ"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"சிறைப்","tr":"ciṟaip"}]},{"text":"பறவை","tr":"paṟavai","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"பற","tr":"paṟa"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"வை","tr":"vai"}]}],[{"text":"இறையுறை","tr":"iṟaiyuṟai","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"இறை","tr":"iṟai"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"யுறை","tr":"yuṟai"}]},{"text":"வோங்கிய","tr":"vōṅkiya","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"வோங்","tr":"vōṅ"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"கிய","tr":"kiya"}]},{"text":"நெறியயல்","tr":"neṟiyayal","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"நெறி","tr":"neṟi"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"யயல்","tr":"yayal"}]},{"text":"மராஅத்த","tr":"marāatta","foot":"puḷimāṅkāy","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"மரா","tr":"marā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"அத்","tr":"at"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"த","tr":"ta"}]}],[{"text":"பிள்ளை","tr":"piḷḷai","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"பிள்","tr":"piḷ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ளை","tr":"ḷai"}]},{"text":"யுள்வாய்ச்","tr":"yuḷvāyc","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"யுள்","tr":"yuḷ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"வாய்ச்","tr":"vāyc"}]},{"text":"செரீஇய","tr":"cerīiya","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"செரீ","tr":"cerī"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"இய","tr":"iya"}]}],[{"text":"இரைகொண்","tr":"iraikoṇ","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"இரை","tr":"irai"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"கொண்","tr":"koṇ"}]},{"text":"டமையின்","tr":"ṭamaiyiṉ","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"டமை","tr":"ṭamai"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"யின்","tr":"yiṉ"}]},{"text":"விரையுமாற்","tr":"viraiyumāṟ","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"விரை","tr":"virai"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"யுமாற்","tr":"yumāṟ"}]},{"text":"செலவே","tr":"celavē","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"செல","tr":"cela"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"வே","tr":"vē"}]}]]},"ai":{"lines":[{"words":[{"surface":"ஞாயிறு","parts":[{"text":"ஞாயிறு","lemma":"ஞாயிறு","gloss":"sun"}],"gloss":"sun"},{"surface":"பட்ட","parts":[{"text":"பட்ட","lemma":"பட்ட","gloss":"that has set"}],"gloss":"that has set","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"அகல்வாய்","parts":[{"text":"அகல்","lemma":"அகல்","gloss":"wide"},{"text":"வாய்","lemma":"வாய்","gloss":"expanse"}],"gloss":"wide-expanse"},{"surface":"வானத்து","parts":[{"text":"வானத்து","lemma":"வானத்து","gloss":"of the sky"}],"gloss":"of the sky","split_unverified":true}]},{"words":[{"surface":"அளிய","parts":[{"text":"அளி","lemma":"அளி","gloss":"pity"},{"text":"அ","lemma":"அ","gloss":"appellative relative participle suffix"}],"gloss":"pitiable"},{"surface":"தாமே","parts":[{"text":"தாம்","lemma":"தாம்","gloss":"they"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"emphatic particle"}],"gloss":"indeed they"},{"surface":"கொடுஞ்சிறைப்","parts":[{"text":"கொடுஞ்சிறைப்","lemma":"கொடுஞ்சிறைப்","gloss":"curved-winged"}],"gloss":"curved-winged","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"பறவை","parts":[{"text":"பறவை","lemma":"பறவை","gloss":"bird"}],"gloss":"birds"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"இறையுறை","parts":[{"text":"இறை","lemma":"இறை","gloss":"perch"},{"text":"உறை","lemma":"உறை","gloss":"dwelling"}],"gloss":"perching dwelling"},{"surface":"ஓங்கிய","parts":[{"text":"ஓங்கிய","lemma":"ஓங்கிய","gloss":"that is lofty"}],"gloss":"that is lofty","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"நெறியயல்","parts":[{"text":"நெறி","lemma":"நெறி","gloss":"path"},{"text":"அயல்","lemma":"அயல்","gloss":"beside"}],"gloss":"beside the path"},{"surface":"மராஅத்த","parts":[{"text":"மராஅத்த","lemma":"மராஅத்த","gloss":"of the kadamba tree"}],"gloss":"of the kadamba tree","split_unverified":true}]},{"words":[{"surface":"பிள்ளை","parts":[{"text":"பிள்ளை","lemma":"பிள்ளை","gloss":"chick"}],"gloss":"chicks"},{"surface":"உள்வாய்ச்","parts":[{"text":"உள்வாய்ச்","lemma":"உள்வாய்ச்","gloss":"inside the mouth"}],"gloss":"inside the mouth","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"செரீஇய","parts":[{"text":"செரீஇய","lemma":"செரீஇய","gloss":"to feed"}],"gloss":"to feed","split_unverified":true}]},{"words":[{"surface":"இரைகொண்டு","parts":[{"text":"இரை","lemma":"இரை","gloss":"food"},{"text":"கொண்டு","lemma":"கொள்","gloss":"having taken"}],"gloss":"having taken food"},{"surface":"அமையின்","parts":[{"text":"அமை","lemma":"அமை","gloss":"to obtain/be satisfied"},{"text":"இன்","lemma":"இன்","gloss":"causal suffix"}],"gloss":"since they have obtained"},{"surface":"விரையுமால்","parts":[{"text":"விரை","lemma":"விரை","gloss":"to hasten"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"உம்","gloss":"habitual tense marker"},{"text":"ஆல்","lemma":"ஆல்","gloss":"emphatic particle"}],"gloss":"indeed they hasten"},{"surface":"செலவே","parts":[{"text":"செலவு","lemma":"செலவு","gloss":"flight"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"emphatic particle"}],"gloss":"the flight"}]}],"literal":"The sun having set in the wide-expanse sky, / pitiable indeed are the curved-winged birds! / On the lofty kadamba tree beside the path where they perch and dwell, / to feed inside the mouths of their chicks, / having obtained food, they indeed hasten their flight.","translation":"The sun has set in the wide expanse of the sky. How pitiable are the curved-winged birds! Having gathered food to feed inside the mouths of their chicks waiting in their high nests on the kadamba tree beside the path, they hasten their homeward flight.","modern":"சூரியன் மறைந்த அகன்ற வானத்தில், வளைந்த சிறகுகளைக் கொண்ட பறவைகள் இரக்கத்திற்குரியவை. வழியின் பக்கத்தில் உள்ள உயர்ந்த மராஅ மரத்தில் இருக்கும் தங்களுடைய கூடுகளில் உள்ள குஞ்சுகளின் வாயினுள் ஊட்டுவதற்காக, இரையைத் தேடிக் கொண்டுவிட்டதால், அவை தங்களுடைய இருப்பிடத்தை நோக்கி விரைந்து பறக்கின்றன.","explanation":"This poem is spoken by the heroine to her companion or to herself during the evening, expressing her deep grief over the hero's absence. As the sun sets, she observes the curved-winged birds returning to their nests on the tall kadamba tree beside the path. Having gathered food, these birds are rushing back to feed their hungry chicks waiting in the nests. The heroine feels that even these simple birds show deep love and responsibility by returning home at dusk, whereas her beloved hero remains away. This contrast between the birds' timely return and the hero's delay intensifies her loneliness and longing.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.7],[0.7,1.0],[1.0,1.1],[1.1,1.6],[1.6,2.5],[2.5,2.6],[2.6,3.5],[3.5,3.8],[3.8,4.2],[4.2,5.2],[5.2,5.7],[5.7,6.1],[6.1,6.76],[6.76,7.3],[7.6,7.7],[7.7,8.83],[8.83,9.15],[9.15,9.6],[9.6,9.92]],"female":[[0.0,0.8],[0.8,1.0],[1.0,1.1],[1.1,1.8],[1.8,2.6],[2.6,3.0],[3.2,3.95],[3.95,4.1],[4.1,4.42],[4.42,6.0],[6.0,6.2],[6.2,7.2],[7.2,9.66],[9.66,9.66],[9.66,9.66],[9.66,9.66],[9.66,9.66],[9.66,11.3],[11.3,11.7]]}}